        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is already possible with [`custom_textobjects`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/df1559e2ed7ece458e0a97a8bb9556d465d1c775/doc/mini-ai.txt#L464). To change textobject with id `\"` to use regular 'from \" to \"' matching without balancing, use the following:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nrequire('mini.ai').setup({\r\n  custom_textobjects = {\r\n    -- Match without balancing\r\n    ['\"'] = { '\"().-()\"' },\r\n  },\r\n})\r\n```",
